  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 109 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json). The boss order is the script order (Jammal'an before the two drakes), the packs are the spawn clusters nearest each boss; walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "A wait_for on a door a lever or key opens needs timeout_s 60 (the default): a linked door can open 30 s after the use.",
    "Needs: six Atal'ai statues (GO_ATALAI_STATUE_1-6) lit in order summon Atal'alarion; the six troll mini-bosses (5712-5717) are the statues' guards",
    "Needs: four Eternal Flames (GO_ETERNAL_FLAME_1-4) summon the Avatar of Hakkar (8443, no spawn row)",
    "Needs: Jammal'an's barrier (GO_JAMMALAN_BARRIER) and the Hakkar doors (GO_HAKKAR_DOOR_1-2)",
    "Needs: Shade of Eranikus needs the Essence of Eranikus path and the Altar of Hakkar",
    "Census 2026-10-23 (map 109 spawn export, no live run): fleers 5259 and 5273 (EventAI command 47 at 15% HP); cc_priority 5259,5273,5269,5226 (the healers, the Hex, the Slowing Poison); cc_always 5259; kill_first 5271,5280,5291 (Fear, Sleep, Frostbolt Volley with the Swoop summon). Radii cut on pulls 0.5, 3.2 and 3.3 so a row does not take the next pack (same entries, 14.4-26.8 yd), and set to 17 yd on the seven Hakkari Frostwing 5291 pulls (their wander is 15 yd).",
    "FIXED 2026-10-24 (boss order): the instance script keeps Weaver 5720 and Dreamscythe 5721 (VISIBILITY_OFF, not selectable, immune, patrol idle) and Shade of Eranikus 5709 (not selectable, immune, sleeping) until SetData(TYPE_JAMMALAN, DONE) (instance_sunken_temple.cpp:384-408, gated on m_auiEncounter[2]); the legs are now atal'alarion, jammal'an_the_prophet, weaver, dreamscythe, morphaz, shade_of_eranikus, so the Weaver and Dreamscythe boss rows come after Jammal'an. Jammal'an's leg carries the walkway via from the old weaver leg (atal'alarion hold spot back up to -300 100.5 -172.1).",
    "Patrols: 5708 Spawn of Hakkar (guids 33621 and 34520, 12-point paths spanning about 190 yd) and Murk Worm 5226 (guids 33676 46 points and 34168 4 points) walk the halls the plan clears; the pull rows carry no patrol path, so a pull of one of them can find nothing at its point (the run leader then reads the pack as cleared) and they can join later fights.",
    "FIXED 2026-10-25 (r38 slotD polish): (1) the Atal'alarion leg's island gap (run pause at step 236, lead at -448.0 103.2 -191.0, three moves refused): the walk off Atal'ai platform to the z -172.9 ring crossed the pool floor 3.2 yd under the navmesh. Group 9 now carries four approach points up the east ramp (-448 96 -188.9, -440 96 -184.6, -432 96.5 -179.6, -424 99 -174.8), each hop server path-checked from the live fight spot (all type 0x1 ok); the exporter's own cut had gone to -448 103.2 -187.83, above the pool. (2) dreamscythe's deferred pack (5714 at -467.2 26.3 -67.0, 'never within reach' at r38 step 2194): its platform is reached only from the -53.9 hall by the ramp (-512 26.4 -53.83, -490.67 21.33 -61.83, -484.53 18.13 -64.93, the stand 19.3 yd from the pack); the group moves after the hall group (-481 1.4 -53.9) so the party is on that floor when it walks up. (3) the wasted-time round trip of r38 steps 1981-2103 (down the spiral to the statue ring for 5 packs and back up, 1774 yd of rows for 191 yd of ring): the five statue-ring packs (8311/8384 at -546 151, -555 131, -564 105, -533 115, -522 93) move into the Atal'alarion leg after its last statue-ring group (-508.5 183), 50 yd from it and 10 yd from the first statue stand; dreamscythe then walks group 8 -> group 9 (-555.5 270.6 -90.8 -> -542.9 94.3 -90.9) on the ring in 191 yd. Every reordered hop is server path-checked (type 0x1 ok); pulls move nobody."
  ],
